00000","highlight_text_color":"","spacing_bottom":12}},"text_gVrYCB":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>apart from that one, obviously. &lt;br&gt;<\/p><p>wear an idiom on its own. &lt;br&gt;<\/p><p>layer idiom on idiom. currently 7 fragrances, giving 120 combinations. &lt;br&gt;<\/p><p>layer an idiom over a fragrance you already own. make something new. &lt;br&gt;<\/p><p>it's endless. in a good way.<\/p>","size":100,"text_position":"left","spacing_bottom":12}},"button_fX3dc4":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_text":"LEARN HOW THE COMMUNITY ARE LAYERING","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--secondary","button_style":"btn--solid","button_size":"btn--small","video_link":"","text_position":"left","spacing_bottom":12}}},"block_order":["heading_PMiM69","text_gVrYCB","button_fX3dc4"],"name":"Image with text","settings":{"show_accordion_divider":true,"increase_border_radius":false,"section_height":"five-fifty-height","enable_mobile_height":true,"mobile_height":"three-fifty-height-mobile","layout":"inline","image_location":"right","image_width":"standard","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PALO.jpg","block_bg_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"text-dark","bg_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","gradient":"","section_width":"wrapper","add_gutter":true,"padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":0}},"section_image_with_text_MRLHwq":{"type":"section-image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_K7pthw":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"<p>we create single-minded fragrances<\/p>","size":120,"text_position":"left","heading_highlight_type":"underline-hand-drawn","highlight_color":"#000000","highlight_text_color":"","spacing_bottom":12}},"text_Fwn8Kf":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>each idiom is built around one &lt;br&gt;<\/p><p>compelling ingredient. We highlight its richness and character using other notes to complement and enhance it — like backing singers. &lt;br&gt;<\/p><p>This elusive combination of clarity and soul is what makes our fragrances layer beautifully and smell distinctive and expressive when worn alone.<\/p>","size":100,"text_position":"left","spacing_bottom":12}},"button_FqbJW9":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_text":"shop the idioms","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/shop-everything","button_color":"btn--black","button_style":"btn--solid","button_size":"btn--small","video_link":"","text_position":"left","spacing_bottom":12}}},"block_order":["heading_K7pthw","text_Fwn8Kf","button_FqbJW9"],"name":"Image with text","settings":{"show_accordion_divider":true,"increase_border_radius":false,"section_height":"six-fifty-height","enable_mobile_height":true,"mobile_height":"three-fifty-height-mobile","layout":"inline","image_location":"left","image_width":"standard","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/fb20e462-6972-404b-b029-2679e120d041.png","block_bg_color":"","text_color":"text-dark","bg_color":"","gradient":"","section_width":"wrapper","add_gutter":true,"padding_top":32,"padding_bottom":48}},"idiom_loyalty_kib4za":{"type":"idiom-loyalty","name":"Loyalty \/ Society","settings":{"card_bg":"#9a9a35","text_color":"#fffbf3","image_width":1,"image_ratio":"4\/3","girl_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/124567.gif","eyebrow":"Magazines. Time. Buy, don't buy - we'd be happy to see you. Oh, and bring a fragrance you already own to layer with if you like.<br>12 Ingestre Place, Soho London W1F 0JF","heading":"visit us in our soho shop. <br>we have armchairs.","cta_label":"visit our soho store","cta_url":"","button_bg":"#1a1a1a","button_text_color":"#ffffff","cloud_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/3_ff4eebdd-a4d7-4cf1-959f-af017085cd0b.png","cloud_size":180,"cloud_top":-8,"cloud_left":28,"cloud_size_mobile":100,"cloud_top_mobile":-6,"cloud_left_mobile":20,"butterfly_size":90,"butterfly_top":2,"butterfly_left":42,"butterfly_size_mobile":55,"butterfly_top_mobile":-4,"butterfly_left_mobile":60,"moon_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/4_98de9911-5922-4f87-999e-1f1c83e77ed4.png","moon_size":200,"moon_top":80,"moon_left":82,"moon_size_mobile":100,"moon_top_mobile":92,"moon_left_mobile":66}},"section_image_with_text_xxz7FR":{"type":"section-image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_nDMqdj":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"<p>The importance of not being earnest.<\/p>","size":90,"text_position":"left","heading_highlight_type":"underline-hand-drawn","highlight_color":"#000000","highlight_text_color":"","spacing_bottom":12}},"text_cxDKep":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Perfume can be a serious business.<\/p><p>&lt;br&gt; But we try not to take ourselves too seriously. Most people don’t.<\/p><p>&lt;br&gt; We obviously love perfume. The craft, the ingredients, the strange alchemy of it all. For us, fragrance comes alive when you wear it. It’s the beginning of something — a night, a story, a mood. It’s about your associations and memories, not a perfumer's vision of a breezy, Balinese sunset. We want to give people the tools to create their own fragrance wardrobe.<\/p><p>&lt;br&gt; We have huge respect for perfume history and other brands. It’s just that we're not terribly interested in the rules, conventions and traditions that surround making and selling fragrance.<\/p><p>&lt;br&gt; Our fragrances are for people who want to go their own way. Not out of rebellion or because of a manifesto, but rather just because that's the way they feel like going. <\/p><p>&lt;br&gt; And our shop is more lounge than shop. Somewhere to feel at home, experiment and discover, without being sold to or having to spend a week’s rent to buy something.<\/p><p>&lt;br&gt; London has a lot to do with how we see things. New and ancient, grand and grubby, beautiful and strange all rub along together, and nobody finds it particularly remarkable. Things get mixed up. They always have, for thousands of years.<\/p><p>&lt;br&gt; And London is where idiom started<\/p>","size":100,"text_position":"left","spacing_bottom":12}},"button_ygxQDU":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"button_text":"LEARN HOW THE COMMUNITY ARE LAYERING","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--secondary","button_style":"btn--solid","button_size":"btn--small","video_link":"","text_position":"left","spacing_bottom":12}}},"block_order":["heading_nDMqdj","text_cxDKep","button_ygxQDU"],"name":"Image with text","settings":{"show_accordion_divider":true,"increase_border_radius":false,"section_height":"five-fifty-height","enable_mobile_height":true,"mobile_height":"three-fifty-height-mobile","layout":"inline","image_location":"right","image_width":"standard","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PALO.jpg","block_bg_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"text-dark","bg_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","gradient":"","section_width":"wrapper","add_gutter":true,"padding_top":14,"padding_bottom":42}},"idiom_brand_story_CpaKFp":{"type":"idiom-brand-story","blocks":{"phrase_jznkrf":{"type":"phrase","settings":{"text":"ACOUSTIC ROSE"}},"phrase_aVwYAi":{"type":"phrase","settings":{"text":"WILD PEPPER"}},"phrase_xEKbJy":{"type":"phrase","settings":{"text":"VETIVER ACE"}},"phrase_hU77rL":{"type":"phrase","settings":{"text":"3D AMPLIFIER"}},"phrase_WkV3fk":{"type":"phrase","settings":{"text":"PALO SANTAL"}},"phrase_yEaTM9":{"type":"phrase","settings":{"text":"LIME BOSSA"}}},"block_order":["phrase_jznkrf","phrase_aVwYAi","phrase_xEKbJy","phrase_hU77rL","phrase_WkV3fk","phrase_yEaTM9"],"name":"Brand Story","settings":{"butterfly_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_c4d0fbf5-e5d2-43fc-bba0-f6841fca5da5.png","moon_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2_8dc70a26-7a0b-4863-85a5-abc264607dba.png","heading":"idiom started as an argument between the three of us...","subline":"","body":"a fragrance insider, a skincare founder, and an opinionated designer:\n<br>\n<br>\nabout tea,\n<br>\nabout fashion,\n<br>\nabout London,\n<br>\n<br>\nabout almost everything,\n<br>\n<br>\nexcept fragrance. On that, we  <i>somehow<\/i>  all agreed.","cta_label":"","cta_url":"","grid_heading":"","grid_subtext":""}},"section_text_T6Apqa":{"type":"section-text","blocks":{"image_Q9C7jk":{"type":"image","se